### 1. Create Single Student Attendance
POST {{attendanceUrl}}/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "{{studentId}}",
  "date": "2026-03-01",
  "status": "Present",
  "markedBy": "{{teacherId}}"
}

### 2. Bulk Create or Update Class Attendance
POST {{attendanceUrl}}/attendance/bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "studentId": "{{studentId}}",
    "date": "2026-03-01",
    "status": "Present",
    "markedBy": "{{teacherId}}"
  }
]

### 3. Get Attendance Record by ID
GET {{attendanceUrl}}/attendance/{{attendanceRecordId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 4. Get Student Attendance History
GET {{attendanceUrl}}/attendance/student/{{studentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 5. Delete Attendance Record
DELETE {{attendanceUrl}}/attendance/{{attendanceRecordId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 6. Create Disciplinary Record
POST {{attendanceUrl}}/discipline
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "{{studentId}}",
  "recordedBy": "{{teacherId}}",
  "incidentType": "Warning",
  "description": "Late arrival for morning assembly.",
  "actionTaken": "Counseled by class teacher.",
  "date": "2026-03-01T08:15:00Z"
}

### 7. Get Disciplinary Record by ID
GET {{attendanceUrl}}/discipline/{{disciplinaryRecordId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 8. Get All Student Disciplinary Records
GET {{attendanceUrl}}/discipline/student/{{studentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 9. Update Disciplinary Record
PATCH {{attendanceUrl}}/discipline/{{disciplinaryRecordId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionTaken": "Follow-up meeting held with parent and student."
}

### 10. Delete Disciplinary Record
DELETE {{attendanceUrl}}/discipline/{{disciplinaryRecordId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}